{"actions":[],"cardId":"cardid_b6a26f756709da32804e60fd462a1101","createdAt":"2026-03-15T00:18:56Z","expiresAt":"2026-03-17T00:18:56Z","icon":"square.grid.2x2","id":"card_c7c558ef484abe3b09b0e5a562797c46","message":"The Iran war escalated sharply today — five US tankers hit at Prince Sultan, the Baghdad embassy struck, and Fujairah port attacked. Meanwhile you shipped two big game fixes and published your latest article.","metadata":{"height":620,"htmlContent":"<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><meta name='color-scheme' content='light dark'><style>:root{--bg:var(--fw-bg,#ffffff);--text:var(--fw-text,#111827);--muted:var(--fw-text-secondary,#6b7280);--tertiary:var(--fw-text-tertiary,#9ca3af);--border:var(--fw-border,rgba(15,23,42,0.08));--accent:var(--fw-accent,#2563eb);--surface:var(--fw-surface,#f3f4f6)}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:var(--fw-bg,#1c1c1e);--text:var(--fw-text,#f2f2f7);--muted:var(--fw-text-secondary,#a0a0a0);--tertiary:var(--fw-text-tertiary,#707070);--border:var(--fw-border,rgba(255,255,255,0.1));--accent:var(--fw-accent,#4b93ff);--surface:var(--fw-surface,#2a2a2a)}}body{margin:0;padding:20px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg)}*{box-sizing:border-box}h4{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3}.subtitle{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.4}.divider{border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:0}.date{font-size:13px;color:var(--tertiary);margin:0 0 12px}.story{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:14px 0}.story-text{flex:1;min-width:0}.story-headline{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 4px}.story-summary{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px}.story-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--tertiary)}.story-category{background:var(--border);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:500;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.03em}.story-img{width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;background:var(--border);flex-shrink:0}</style></head><body><div class='date'>Mar 14 Saturday · π Day</div><h4>Iran hits US planes in Saudi, your Dungeon Crawl ships shops</h4><div class='subtitle'>The Iran war escalated sharply today. Meanwhile you shipped two big game fixes and a new article.</div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>Five KC-135 tankers damaged at Prince Sultan Air Base</div><div class='story-summary'>An IRGC ballistic missile struck PSAB, damaging five US Air Force refueling planes on the ground. No fatalities, but it brings the total damaged tankers in Operation Epic Fury to six. Trump called on UK and allies to help break the Hormuz blockade.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Iran War</span><span>· WSJ / The Aviationist · Today</span></div></div><img class='story-img' src='https://theaviationist.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Five-KC-135s-damaged.jpeg' alt='KC-135 at PSAB' onerror=\"this.style.background='var(--surface)';this.alt='';this.onerror=null\"></div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>Baghdad embassy and Fujairah port also hit</div><div class='story-summary'>A missile of unknown origin struck the US embassy in Baghdad. Separately, drones targeted Fujairah's bunkering hub in the UAE and damaged Kuwait's Ahmad al-Jaber Air Base. The conflict is now touching five countries simultaneously.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Conflict</span><span>· Reuters / Politico · Today</span></div></div></div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>Dungeon Crawl: shops and wand fix shipped</div><div class='story-summary'>Wands now fire at adjacent enemies (the worst bug). NetHack-style shopkeepers spawn from floor 2 — gold finally has a purpose. Health potions, ATK/DEF boosts, sight scrolls, and wands for sale.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Your work</span><span>· Tonight</span></div></div></div><hr class='divider'><div class='story'><div class='story-text'><div class='story-headline'>Crash Report #78 published — \"The Unbuckled 8%\"</div><div class='story-summary'>Scheduler waited for the daily reset, then shipped it first thing. Newsletter still blocked on Firebase RTDB rules across all 3 sites.</div><div class='story-meta'><span class='story-category'>Publishing</span><span>· vehicle-safety.org · Today</span></div></div></div></body></html>"},"priority":"medium","state":"active","subType":"briefing","subtitle":"Iran strikes US planes in Saudi Arabia, your Dungeon Crawl ships shops, and Crash Report #78 goes live","timestamp":"2026-03-15T00:18:56Z","title":"Saturday evening briefing","type":"html-webview"}
