{"actions":[],"cardId":"cardid_64de6c49bb2eb9b42a3e07f8d00ab768","createdAt":"2026-03-15T00:18:56Z","expiresAt":"2026-03-17T00:18:56Z","icon":"square.grid.2x2","id":"card_316fa7d37c19c3704b314eb456bc51d2","message":"Three quick playtest moves before calling it done for the weekend.","metadata":{"height":330,"htmlContent":"<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><meta name='color-scheme' content='light dark'><style>:root{--bg:var(--fw-bg,#ffffff);--text:var(--fw-text,#111827);--muted:var(--fw-text-secondary,#6b7280);--tertiary:var(--fw-text-tertiary,#9ca3af);--border:var(--fw-border,rgba(15,23,42,0.08));--accent:var(--fw-accent,#2563eb);--surface:var(--fw-surface,#f3f4f6)}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:var(--fw-bg,#1c1c1e);--text:var(--fw-text,#f2f2f7);--muted:var(--fw-text-secondary,#a0a0a0);--tertiary:var(--fw-text-tertiary,#707070);--border:var(--fw-border,rgba(255,255,255,0.1));--accent:var(--fw-accent,#4b93ff);--surface:var(--fw-surface,#2a2a2a)}}body{margin:0;padding:20px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg)}*{box-sizing:border-box}h4{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3}.subtitle{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.4}.msg{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.4}.divider{border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:0}.item{padding:12px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4}.item strong{font-weight:600}.item-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:2px 0 0}</style></head><body><h4>Dungeon Crawl: what to playtest next</h4><div class='subtitle'>You fixed wands and shipped shops tonight — here's what to stress-test</div><p class='msg'>Three quick playtest moves before calling it done for the weekend.</p><hr class='divider'><div class='item'><strong>Buy a wand from the shop, then zap it at an adjacent enemy</strong><div class='item-desc'>Tests the two features you just built in sequence. Make sure wand charges decrement correctly after purchase and that the fire animation triggers properly with a mob in melee range.</div></div><hr class='divider'><div class='item'><strong>Run a gold-starved playthrough</strong><div class='item-desc'>Skip gold piles and see if pricing feels punishing. If the shop is unreachable without grinding, the economy may need a small buff to gold drops or cheaper tier-1 items.</div></div><hr class='divider'><div class='item'><strong>Push to floor 5+ and check shopkeeper spawn rate</strong><div class='item-desc'>One per floor starting floor 2 means you'll see three by floor 4. Is that too many? Too few? Check if shop placement ever blocks corridors or overlaps with stairways.</div></div></body></html>"},"priority":"medium","state":"active","subType":"suggestions","subtitle":"You fixed wands and shipped shops tonight — here's what to stress-test","timestamp":"2026-03-15T00:18:56Z","title":"Dungeon Crawl: what to playtest next","type":"html-webview"}
